extension SignedInteger {
    /// Returns the greatest common divisor of `self` and `other`.
    ///
    /// The result is always non‑negative, and is consistent with the usual
    /// mathematical definition of GCD.  If both values are zero, the result is zero.
    ///
    /// - Parameter other: Another value of the same type.
