/// Evaluates a generalized continued fraction of the form:
///
///     numerator₀ / (denominator₀ + numerator₁ / (denominator₁ + numerator₂ / (denominator₂ + …)))
///
/// where the pairs (denominatorᵢ, numeratorᵢ) are taken from the two input sequences.
